<div data-fuse="22871471544"></div>
</div>

<p>404 Media reporter Emanuel Maiberg <a href="https://www.404media.co/we-tracked-a-shipment-of-rare-books-it-ended-at-an-amazon-ai-training-facility/">tracked the path of one such book</a>, which eventually wound up at a Las Vegas scanning facility run by Amazon. Though undergirded by advanced technology, the work done there is simple: digitize as many books as possible, <a href="https://www.inc.com/georgia-fearn/amazon-buying-up-older-books-destroying-after-scanning-back-to-2024/91392000">then destroy them</a>.</p>
